 "note": "The press-two-tabs latch, v7, on the Scout pack (222.0 g with its cartridge). The same latch module as the Overseer's: same slider, springs, 3 x 20 dowels and grabber blades. Cut at the tab line. The XT60 is 42.9 mm from the pull, so the two nubs carry 160.1 N (worst index 0.483). In the landing funnel: clear seated, landing and on the swap path; the cartridge passes the hole with 5.3 mm a side. Numbers under the viewer.",
